# Results. These are large and can be regenerated, so they stay out of git.
outputs/checkpoints/
outputs/eval/
# `outputs/videos/*` and not `outputs/videos/`: git will not descend into an
# excluded DIRECTORY, so a `!` rule underneath one can never take effect. Naming
# the contents keeps the directory itself visible and lets the negations below work.
outputs/videos/*
# ...but keep the sample rollout clips, which are a submission deliverable.
# The GIFs and their traces are what sample_videos.md embeds, so ignoring them
# ships that page with eight broken images. MP4s are deliberately NOT kept: they
# cannot be embedded in Markdown and scripts/08_video.py regenerates them.
!outputs/videos/gifs/
outputs/perturbation/
outputs/labels/
outputs/subgoal_labels.parquet
outputs/libero10_episodes.json

# But DO keep the analysis and the figures: they are the evidence.
!outputs/analysis/
!outputs/analysis/**

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.venv/
